t-foregroundDimmest text-lg line-clamp-3">Replit is the most secure place t=
o vibe code. Today, we're making it dramatically easier to use the Security=
 Center to understand your security posture across all Replit projects in y=
our business. We=E2=80=99re also making it possible to remediate urgent sec=
urity holes, such as active critical vulnerabilities on multiple published =
projects, in seconds.

You can reach the Security Center from the Replit Homepage, or your Setting=
s. When you land there, the first thing we want to answer is simple: which =
of my projects are actually at risk right now?



Start with what's urgent

